<html xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" xmlns:w="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>ארכיטקטורת הפתרון</title>
<style>body{font-family:Arial;direction:rtl;font-size:11pt;color:#16325c} h1{color:#032d60} h2{color:#0176d3;border-bottom:2px solid #0176d3;padding-bottom:2px} h3{color:#0176d3} code{font-family:Consolas;background:#eef3f8;padding:0 2px} th,td{border:1px solid #d8dde6}</style></head><body>
<h1>ארכיטקטורת הפתרון — מחולל טפסים דיגיטליים נייטיבי (Salesforce PSS)</h1>
<p><i>מסמך טכני מלא · מודל נתונים · זרימות מידע · יכולות רישוי PSS · אבטחה · CI/CD · API v62.0 · עברית/RTL</i></p>
<h2>1. מבט-על</h2><p>מחולל טפסים דיגיטליים לרשות מקומית: יצירת טפסים ללא קוד, פרסום ציבורי (Experience Cloud), קליטה, בדיקת AI מבוססת קלוד (כולל OCR), ניתוב ואישור נייטיבי, וטאב תוצאות. גישת Native-first על PSS, רב-רשותיות תחת ORG אחד, עברית/RTL ונגישות.</p>
<p><b>היקף:</b> 9 אובייקטים · 14 מחלקות Apex (שירות) · 8 רכיבי LWC · 7 מחלקות בדיקה · 2 Permission Sets · 3 CI Workflows.</p>
<h2>2. שכבות</h2><ol><li><b>ציבורית</b> — Experience Cloud (LWR, Guest): dynamicForm/publicForm — אשף רב-שלבי, העלאת קבצים, ולידציה + ולידציית קובץ בזמן העלאה.</li><li><b>ניהול פנימית</b> — Lightning App «SF_Forms»: formBuilder, formManager, formResults, formAdmin, formSettings, formAiReview.</li><li><b>שירותים (Apex)</b> — 14 מחלקות.</li><li><b>מודל נתונים</b> — Custom Objects.</li><li><b>אינטגרציה</b> — Anthropic Claude API.</li></ol>
<h2>3. רכיבי Apex</h2>
<table border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="4" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:10pt">
<tr><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">מחלקה</th><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">Sharing</th><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">תפקיד</th></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>FormRenderController</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">with</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">מגיש תבנית פעילה לטופס הציבורי</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>FormResponseController</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">without</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">submitResponse — ולידציה + יצירת הגשה (אורח)</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>FormValidationService</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">—</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">flattenFields, ת&quot;ז, ולידציית סכימה</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>FormFileService</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">without</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">attachFiles — ContentVersion + Link</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>FormFileValidationService</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">without</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">validateFile — סוג + אימות תוכן/זהות ב-AI בהעלאה</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>FormResponseAnswerService</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">—</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Trigger AfterInsert → פירוק JSON ל-Form_Answer</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>FormRoutingService</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">—</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">ניתוב (מחלקה/SLA) + הטבעת Tenant/Authority</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>FormAIReviewService</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">without</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">runReview (בדיקה+OCR+החלטה), narrate, requestCompletion, getReview</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>ApprovalDecisionService</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">without</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">טבלת החלטה דטרמיניסטית (סף → מסלול)</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>AnthropicClient</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">without</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">מקור אמת יחיד לקריאות Claude</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>FormBuilderController</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">with (USER_MODE)</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">CRUD לתבניות + הגדרות AI</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>FormResultsController</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">with (USER_MODE)</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">אגרגציה, תובנות, drill-down, CSV</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>FormAdminController</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">with (USER_MODE)</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">סוגי שירות + מחלקות</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>FormSettingsController</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">with</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">הגדרות מנוע AI (ארגון)</td></tr>
</table>
<h2>4. זרימות מידע</h2>
<h3>הגשה וקליטה</h3><p>מילוי → ולידציית קובץ (סוג+AI) → submitResponse (ולידציה בצד שרת) → Insert (הטבעת Tenant/Authority) → Trigger→Form_Answer → סימוכין FR-xxxxx.</p>
<h3>בדיקת AI + OCR + החלטה</h3><p>runReview → קלוד מולטי-מודלי (prompt+צרופות, OCR) → ApprovalDecisionService (אחוז נכות + שלמות מסמכים → מסלול) → עדכון AI_Status/Approval_Route/Findings → Form_Interaction + מייל השלמה לפונה בעת חוסר.</p>
<h3>ניתוב ואישור</h3>
<table border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="4" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:10pt">
<tr><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">קלט</th><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">מסלול (Approval_Route)</th></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">≥90% + מסמכים</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">אישור אוטומטי</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">60–89% + מסמכים</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">ועדת חריגים → Approval Process → Queue SF_Forms_Committee</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><60% + מסמכים</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">בדיקה ידנית</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">חוסר מסמכים</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">השלמה מול הפונה (Needs_Info)</td></tr>
</table>
<h3>תוצאות ותובנות</h3><p>getResults (אגרגציה+KPI+גרפים) → generateAiInsights (נשמר על התבנית עם תאריך+ספירה) → drill-down (שדות+קבצים+שרשור AI) → ייצוא CSV.</p>
<h2>5. אבטחה ורב-רשותיות</h2><ul><li><b>בידוד:</b> Restriction Rule — Tenant_Code__c = $User.Authority_Code__c (מוטבע בקליטה).</li><li><b>אכיפת FLS/CRUD:</b> WITH USER_MODE + DML as user בקונטרולרים הפנימיים; מסלול אורח במצב מערכת בכוונה.</li><li><b>הרשאות:</b> SF_Forms_Manager (פנימי), SF_Forms_Public_Submit (אורח, create-only).</li><li><b>סודות:</b> מפתח LLM אינו מוחזר ללקוח; מומלץ Named/External Credential בפרודקשן.</li></ul>
<h2>6. יכולות רישוי PSS</h2>
<table border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="4" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:10pt">
<tr><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">יכולת</th><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">סטטוס</th><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">הערה</th></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Experience Cloud (LWR)</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">בשימוש</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">אתר ציבורי</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Restriction Rules/Sharing</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">בשימוש</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">בידוד רב-רשותי</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Approval Processes + Queues</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">בשימוש</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">ועדת חריגים</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Business Rules Engine</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">חלקי</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Apex Decision Table; עיצוב Expression Set מוכן</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Action Plans</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">מתועד</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">תבנית מוכנה — דורש הפעלת האובייקט</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">OmniStudio</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">מתועד</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">מסלול הסבה מתועד</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Document Checklist Items</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">חלקי</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">DocumentChecklistItem זמין</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Case Mgmt + Entitlements</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">זמין</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">פוטנציאל SLA/ניתוב</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Public Sector Intake</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">זמין</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">פוטנציאל מודל אינטייק</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Einstein/Agentforce GenAI</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">חסום — נעקף דרך Claude</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"></td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Intelligent Document Reader (OCR)</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">חסום — נעקף דרך Claude</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"></td></tr>
</table>
<h2>7. CI/CD</h2><ul><li>Deploy to org — פריסה אמיתית + permset + smoke.</li><li>Validate against org — dry-run + בדיקות.</li><li>Salesforce CI — scratch org (מדלג ללא Dev Hub).</li><li>RunSpecifiedTests (הארגון מכיל בדיקות זרות כושלות מראש).</li></ul>
<h2>נספח א׳ — מילון שדות מלא</h2>
<h3>Form_Template__c — הגדרת טופס (תוכן ללא קוד) (13 שדות)</h3>
<table border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="4" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:10pt">
<tr><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">שדה (API)</th><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">סוג</th><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">תווית</th><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">תיאור</th></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>AI_Check_Attachments__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Checkbox</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">AI Check Attachments</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Ask the AI to verify the uploaded files match what the form requires.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>AI_Contact_Applicant__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Checkbox</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">AI Contact Applicant</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Allow the AI agent to proactively email the applicant a completion link when something is missing.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>AI_Insights_Generated_At__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">DateTime</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">AI Insights Generated At</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">When the persisted AI insights were generated.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>AI_Insights_Record_Count__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Number</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">AI Insights Record Count</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Number of submissions the persisted AI insights were computed over.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>AI_Insights__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">LongTextArea</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">AI Insights</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">The most recently generated AI insights text for this form&#x27;s results (persisted so it shows on later visits).</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>AI_Review_Enabled__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Checkbox</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">AI Review Enabled</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">When on, submissions of this form can be reviewed by the AI agent.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>AI_Review_Instructions__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">LongTextArea</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">AI Review Instructions</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">What the AI agent must verify in each submission (e.g. required attachments and their content).</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Active__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Checkbox</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Active</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Only active templates are served to the public renderer.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Authority__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Lookup</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Authority</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"></td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Description__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Text</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Description</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Optional description shown to the respondent.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>External_Id__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Text</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">External Id</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Unique slug used in the public form URL and stored on Form_Response__c.Form_External_Id__c.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Schema_JSON__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">LongTextArea</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Schema (JSON)</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">The form field definitions as a JSON array: [{key,label,type,required,options,mapTo}].</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Service_Type__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Lookup</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Service Type</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"></td></tr>
</table>
<h3>Form_Response__c — הגשה / פנייה (22 שדות)</h3>
<table border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="4" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:10pt">
<tr><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">שדה (API)</th><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">סוג</th><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">תווית</th><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">תיאור</th></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>AI_Findings__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">LongTextArea</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">AI Findings</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">The AI review summary and any missing/required items.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>AI_Reviewed_At__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">DateTime</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">AI Reviewed At</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"></td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>AI_Status__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Picklist</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">AI Status</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Result of the AI review of this submission.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Approval_Route__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Picklist</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Approval Route</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Deterministic routing decision (set by ApprovalDecisionService): drives the native approval process and reporting.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Authority_Code__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Text (formula)</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Authority Code</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">The response&#x27;s authority code (from Authority). Used by the restriction rule to isolate data per authority.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Authority__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Lookup</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Authority</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"></td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Department__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Lookup</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Department</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"></td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Email__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Email</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Email</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Mapped key field: respondent email.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Form_External_Id__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Text</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Form External Id</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">External identifier / slug of the form (from the form-builder).</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Form_Name__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Text</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Form Name</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Human-readable name of the form this response came from.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Phone__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Phone</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Phone</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Mapped key field: respondent phone.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Respondent_Name__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Text</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Respondent Name</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Mapped key field: respondent full name.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Response_Data__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">LongTextArea</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Response Data (JSON)</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Full set of submitted answers as a JSON object. Source of truth for all answers; the after-insert trigger flattens it into Form_Answer__c rows.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>SLA_Due__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">DateTime</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">SLA Due</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"></td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Service_Type__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Lookup</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Service Type</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"></td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Source_IP__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Text</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Source IP</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Originating IP address of the submission (security/audit).</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Status__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Picklist</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Status</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Handling status for managers.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Subject__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Text</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Subject</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Mapped key field: subject / topic of the submission.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Submitted_At__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">DateTime</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Submitted At</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Timestamp of the submission.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Tenant_Code__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Text</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Tenant Code</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Stamped authority code (from the form&#x27;s authority) used by the restriction rule for per-authority isolation. Restriction rules do not support formula fields, so this is a real stamped field.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Update_Requested__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Checkbox</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Update Requested</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Set when the AI agent has asked the applicant to complete missing items.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Update_Token__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Text</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Update Token</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">One-time token for the applicant&#x27;s secure &quot;complete missing items&quot; link (AI outreach).</td></tr>
</table>
<h3>Form_Answer__c — תשובה מנורמלת פר-שדה (6 שדות)</h3>
<table border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="4" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:10pt">
<tr><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">שדה (API)</th><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">סוג</th><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">תווית</th><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">תיאור</th></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Field_Key__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Text</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Field Key</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Machine key of the answered field (JSON key), e.g. &quot;track&quot;.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Field_Label__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Text</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Field Label</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Display label of the answered field.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Form_Response__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">MasterDetail</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Form Response</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Master-Detail to the parent Form Response.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Value_Date__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Date</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Value (Date)</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Date answer value (for date-based grouping/filtering in reports).</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Value_Number__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Number</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Value (Number)</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Numeric answer value (enables sums and averages in reports).</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Value_Text__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Text</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Value (Text)</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Answer value as text (Text so it can be grouped/filtered in reports). Multi-select values are joined with &quot;; &quot;. Truncated to 255 chars.</td></tr>
</table>
<h3>Form_Interaction__c — שרשור התכתבות AI (5 שדות)</h3>
<table border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="4" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:10pt">
<tr><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">שדה (API)</th><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">סוג</th><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">תווית</th><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">תיאור</th></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Direction__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Picklist</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">כיוון</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"></td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Form_Response__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">MasterDetail</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">פנייה</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"></td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Interaction_Type__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Picklist</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">סוג</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"></td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Message__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">LongTextArea</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">תוכן</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"></td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Occurred_At__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">DateTime</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">מועד</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"></td></tr>
</table>
<h3>Authority__c — רשות מקומית (Tenant) (7 שדות)</h3>
<table border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="4" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:10pt">
<tr><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">שדה (API)</th><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">סוג</th><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">תווית</th><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">תיאור</th></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>AI_Engine__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Text</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">AI Engine</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Per-authority AI engine: Agentforce or External. Falls back to the org default when blank.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Active__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Checkbox</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Active</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"></td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Code__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Text</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Code</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"></td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>LLM_API_Key__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Text</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">LLM API Key</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Per-authority external LLM API key. For production prefer a Named/External Credential.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>LLM_Endpoint__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Text</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">LLM Endpoint</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"></td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>LLM_Model__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Text</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">LLM Model</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"></td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Public_Site_Base_Url__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Text</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Public Site Base URL</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Per-authority public form page base URL. Falls back to the org custom label when blank.</td></tr>
</table>
<h3>Service_Type__c — קטלוג סוג שירות (4 שדות)</h3>
<table border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="4" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:10pt">
<tr><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">שדה (API)</th><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">סוג</th><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">תווית</th><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">תיאור</th></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Active__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Checkbox</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Active</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"></td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Authority__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Lookup</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Authority</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"></td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Default_SLA_Hours__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Number</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Default SLA (Hours)</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"></td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Department__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Lookup</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Department</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"></td></tr>
</table>
<h3>Department__c — מחלקה מטפלת (3 שדות)</h3>
<table border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="4" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:10pt">
<tr><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">שדה (API)</th><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">סוג</th><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">תווית</th><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">תיאור</th></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Active__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Checkbox</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Active</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"></td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Authority__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Lookup</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Authority</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"></td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Email__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Email</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Department Email</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"></td></tr>
</table>
<h3>Form_AI_Setting__c — הגדרות AI (Hierarchy Custom Setting) (4 שדות)</h3>
<table border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="4" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:10pt">
<tr><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">שדה (API)</th><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">סוג</th><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">תווית</th><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">תיאור</th></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Engine__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Text</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">AI Engine</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Which engine runs the AI form review: Agentforce or External.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>LLM_API_Key__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Text</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">LLM API Key</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">API key for the external LLM. For production prefer a Named Credential / External Credential; this field is a convenience store for non-production orgs.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>LLM_Endpoint__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Text</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">LLM Endpoint</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">External LLM API endpoint URL (used when Engine = External).</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>LLM_Model__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Text</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">LLM Model</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">External LLM model id (e.g. claude-opus-4-8). Used when Engine = External.</td></tr>
</table>
<h3>User — משתמש (שדה בידוד) (1 שדות)</h3>
<table border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="4" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:10pt">
<tr><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">שדה (API)</th><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">סוג</th><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">תווית</th><th style="background:#032d60;color:#fff;text-align:right">תיאור</th></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top"><code>Authority_Code__c</code></td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Text</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Authority Code</td><td style="text-align:right;vertical-align:top">Code of the local authority (tenant) this user belongs to. Matched against Authority__c.Code__c for per-authority data isolation.</td></tr>
</table>
</body></html>